    <h1>The 30-30-30 Rule for Men Over 40:<em> Does It Actually Work?</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">30g of protein, 30 minutes after waking, then 30 minutes of movement. The trend is real. Here's what the science actually says — and what's worth keeping.</p>
    <p class="hero-date">Last Updated: October 17, 2026</p>
