        <h3>Train Fasted, Eat After</h3>
        <p>Maximizes fat oxidation during the workout. Works well when fat loss is the primary goal and anabolic signaling is robust.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="compare-card new">
        <div class="compare-label">After 40 (Muscle-First)</div>
        <h3>Protein First, Then Move</h3>
        <p>Ensures amino acids are available during and after training. Prioritizes muscle preservation — the variable that matters most after 40.</p>
